12708 0 obj
<</Title(The Cyberdeck is a custom-built ground support system designed to host and operate the Ground Control Station \(GCS\) along with live video monitoring during rocket missions. It serves as a compact, portable, and integrated hardware platform that brings together all essential components required for real-time telemetry reception, visualization, and situational awareness in field conditions. )/Dest[30 0 R/XYZ 72.0635 704.959 0]/SE 1414 0 R/Parent 13480 0 R/Prev 12699 0 R/Next 12709 0 R>>
endobj

12709 0 obj
<</Title(The system is built around a Raspberry Pi, which runs the GCS software and interfaces with multiple peripherals through USB connections. These include a telemetry receiver PCB \(SHROTA\) for acquiring flight data via LoRa communication and an ESP32 for transmitting GPS data to a mobile application for recovery purposes. The Cyberdeck also incorporates a display unit, keyboard, USB hub, and an uninterrupted power supply \(UPS\), ensuring continuous and reliable operation during outdoor missions. )/Dest[30 0 R/XYZ 72.0977 658.963 0]/SE 1415 0 R/Parent 13480 0 R/Prev 12708 0 R/Next 12710 0 R>>
endobj

12710 0 obj
<</Title(In addition to telemetry handling, the system integrates a separate video reception setup using another Raspberry Pi connected to an EasyCAP video receiver. This enables real-time video feed monitoring alongside telemetry data, enhancing overall mission awareness. )/Dest[30 0 R/XYZ 72.249 601.467 0]/SE 1416 0 R/Parent 13480 0 R/Prev 12709 0 R/Next 12711 0 R>>
endobj

