<</Title(Safety and Reliability )/Dest[38 0 R/XYZ 72.5176 648.447 0]/SE 1679 0 R/Count 10/First 12725 0 R/Last 12734 0 R/Parent 13480 0 R/Prev 12723 0 R/Next 12735 0 R>>
endobj

12725 0 obj
<</Title(Safety and reliability are ensured through a combination of hardware and software safeguards. The bioink system is fully enclosed to prevent leakage, while the control logic incorporates operational limits and a failsafe shutdown triggered by flight conditions. Continuous monitoring of system parameters ensures that the payload operates within safe limits throughout the mission.These features ensure that the payload operates safely within the constraints of the flight environment. )/Dest[38 0 R/XYZ 72.0977 637.115 0]/SE 1680 0 R/Count 2/First 12726 0 R/Last 12727 0 R/Parent 12724 0 R/Next 12728 0 R>>
endobj

