12728 0 obj
<</Title(3. Apogee Predictor )/Dest[42 0 R/XYZ 72.1611 625.449 0]/SE 1953 0 R/Parent 12724 0 R/Prev 12725 0 R/Next 12729 0 R>>
endobj

12729 0 obj
<</Title(The predictor integrates the equations of motion forward in time from the current state, returning the altitude at which velocity reaches zero. It is invoked twice per control tick: once with brakes fully retracted \(yielding p0, the natural-trajectory apogee\) and once fully deployed \(yielding p1, the maximum-drag apogee\). These two values bracket the reachable apogee space and are the sole inputs to the controller inversion )/Dest[42 0 R/XYZ 71.9756 614.115 0]/SE 1954 0 R/Parent 12724 0 R/Prev 12728 0 R/Next 12730 0 R>>
endobj

